    "source_text": "Purpose: inspect one container/image/network/volume with sensitive env/mount values redacted. Input: object_type:container|image|network|volume, id:string. Output: sanitized object metadata. Contract: L2 read_only; scope mac.docker.read; target docker_object; timeout 10000ms; cap 512KiB; local Docker only; no raw socket proxy; secrets redacted; approval trusted_read; idempotent yes. Phase 3 planned."
